# Generated by forge build from forge/seed and the checkout's fixes. Do not edit: see docs/FORGE.md, "Fixing a generated guide".
# Tanaris, Alliance 45 to 46. Consensus route visit 47 (Tanaris); visit 48
# (Searing Gorge) is folded into later guides, see below.
#
# Flow: the Mirage Raceway on the way in (Keeping Pace), Gadgetzan (flight
# path, bind, the first Wastewander bounties), Steamwheedle Port and Lost
# Rigger Cove, the Wastewander camps, the water survey, one sweep through the
# deep desert (Broken Pillar, Dunemaul, Noxious Lair, Thistleshrub) ending
# with Tooga's walk home to Steamwheedle, then Gadgetzan, Caliph and the
# Gaping Chasm, and the hearth. Then north: class training in Ironforge and
# the bind at Aerie Peak for the Hinterlands.
#
# Deviations from the export (local order only): the route enters Tanaris
# from Thousand Needles, so Gadgetzan comes first (flight path, bind, Tran'rek
# and the first bounties) and the Wastewander bandits are killed on the ride
# back from Steamwheedle Port. Tooga is walked home straight from Thistleshrub
# Valley instead of after a hearth and a ride back; Caliph Scorpidsting (2781)
# is taken from the Wanted Poster with Andre Firebeard's bounty on the first
# visit to the port (not on a detour back into the port after Tooga's walk)
# and killed on the way to the Gaping Chasm. One hearth instead of two.
# Gadgetzan from the north starts with Tran'rek; back from Steamwheedle, the
# turn-ins run east to west (Andi Lynn first).
#
# Added: Keeping Pace and Rizzle's Schematics (1190, 1194, with Zamek's
# Distraction 1191), from News for Fizzle (1137, carried from Martek in
# 30-40/06-badlands): the Mirage Raceway lies on the ride in from Thalanaar.
#
# Dropped: the Searing Gorge stop (export visit 48, 0.3 h): a flight and a
# long ride through the Badlands for one turn-in. Caught! (4449) is handed in
# at the same outhouse in 40-50/06-searing-gorge, which goes there anyway.
# Find and Rescue OOX-17/TN! (351, 648): the beacon is a 0.5-1% drop and its
# reward waits in Booty Bay, which the route no longer visits at this level.
# Stoley's Deliver to MacKinley (2874, Booty Bay) for the same reason.
#
# Left out: Screecher Spirits (3520), Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient (2641) and
# Ledger from Tanaris (4450): the route never hands them in.
# Noggenfogger Elixir (2662) is skipped: it needs Delivery for Marin (2661),
# which follows Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient, and that ingredient (the Violet
# Tragan) grows in the Hinterlands, a trip the route never makes from here.
# Class training: Ironforge at 46, on the way north; Ironforge has no druid
# trainer, so Druids train in Darnassus at 47 (40-50/05-the-hinterlands).
guide forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris
title Tanaris
faction Alliance
levels 45-47
zone Tanaris
next forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands

# v1 improved: order from the simulator's search (Human Alliance, 2000000 tries, seeded with v1's order;
# 125.7 h -> 117.5 h to 60 in the model), written by polestar apply-route.
# Added here: Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient (2641).
# The notes above describe v1's order; the steps below are the improved one.

step Thousand Needles
  zone Thousand Needles
  goto 78.1,77.1 "Thousand Needles"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Shimmering Flats

step Mirage Raceway
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip The Mirage Raceway lies on the Shimmering Flats in south-east Thousand Needles. Fizzle Brassbolts and Pozzik are in the camps beside the track.
  turnin 1137                         -- Fizzle Brassbolts
  turnin 2769
  tip Zamek stands by the goblin camp.
  accept 1190                         -- Pozzik
  accept 1191                         -- Zamek
  turnin 1191                         -- He runs off to keep Rizzle busy
  tip While Zamek keeps Rizzle talking, his plans lie unguarded in the gnome camp across the track.
  turnin 1190                         -- Rizzle's Unguarded Plans, inside
  accept 1194
  turnin 1194

step Tanaris
  zone Tanaris
  goto 51.6,26.8 "Tanaris"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Gadgetzan

step Gadgetzan
  zone Tanaris
  tip Ride south-east off the Shimmering Flats into Tanaris. Gadgetzan is just inside the border.
  turnin 2864                         -- Tran'rek, north side of town
  accept 3362                         -- Tran'rek
  accept 992                          -- Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser
  accept 2605                         -- Marin Noggenfogger
  getfp "Gadgetzan" npc 7823          -- Bera Stonehammer
  sethome "Gadgetzan" npc 7733        -- Innkeeper Fizzgrimble
  accept 1690                         -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle, by the water tower
  accept 1707                         -- Spigot Operator Luglunket, next to him
  accept 3022                         -- Curgle Cranklehop: his crate goes to Rut'theran Village, later
  accept 5863                         -- Andi Lynn

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Steamwheedle Port

step Steamwheedle Port
  tip Ride east across the dunes to the goblin harbour on the north-east coast.
  accept 8365                         -- Haughty Modiste
  accept 2781 object 142122           -- The same poster: Caliph comes much later, after Gadgetzan
  accept 2875 object 142122           -- The Wanted poster beside him
  accept 8366                         -- Security Chief Bilgewhizzle, inside
  turnin 2872                         -- Stoley, in the port's tavern; inside
  accept 2873

step Noonshade Ruins: kill these as you meet them
  zone Tanaris
  tip Ride back west toward Gadgetzan. The Wastewander bandits and thieves hold the dunes on the way; any of them can carry a water pouch.
  tip Careful: Wastewander Rogues (level 43-44) move stealthed, so they can approach unseen.
  collect 8483 quest 1707             -- Wastewander Water Pouch
  kill 5616 quest 1690                -- Wastewander Thief
  kill 5618 quest 1690                -- Wastewander Bandit

step Gadgetzan
  turnin 1707                         -- Spigot Operator Luglunket
  accept 1878
  turnin 1690                         -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle
  accept 1691

step Lost Rigger Cove: kill these as you meet them
  zone Tanaris
  tip Follow the coast south to the pirate cove. Southsea pirates crowd the beach and the boats: work along the edge and pull one at a time. Andre Firebeard stands on the far side; Stoley's stolen cargo lies in the camp.
  tip Careful: Two or three pirates stand with Andre, and many more pirates from the town join the fight once it starts.
  kill 7855 quest 8366                -- Southsea Pirate
  collect 20519 quest 8365            -- Southsea Pirate Hat
  kill 7856 quest 8366                -- Southsea Freebooter
  kill 7858 quest 8366                -- Southsea Swashbuckler
  collect 9244 x1 quest 2873          -- Stoley's Shipment; upstairs
  kill 7857 quest 8366                -- Southsea Dock Worker
  collect 9246 x1 quest 2875          -- Firebeard's Head

step Waterspring Field: kill these as you meet them
  zone Tanaris
  tip The tougher Wastewander rogues, shadow mages and assassins camp south-east of Gadgetzan, south of the bandits. Leave Caliph Scorpidsting in the middle of the southern camp for later.
  tip Careful: Thieves cast Disarm. Rogues stay hidden with Sneak. Assassins use Execute when your health is at 20% or lower.
  tip Careful: Wastewander Rogues keep Sneak up while out of combat, so hidden rogues can join a fight you start at a camp.
  collect 8483 quest 1878             -- Wastewander Water Pouch
  kill 5617 quest 1691                -- Wastewander Shadow Mage
  kill 5623 quest 1691                -- Wastewander Assassin
  kill 5615 quest 1691                -- Wastewander Rogue

step The pool by Sandsorrow Watch
  tip Ride north-west to the Sandfury troll camp at Sandsorrow Watch. Use the Untapped Dowsing Widget at the edge of its pool; the trolls stand close, so pull the nearest first.
  use 8584 quest 992.1 @39.9,28.4 "Pool by Sandsorrow Watch" -- Gives the Tapped Dowsing Widget

step Gadgetzan
  turnin 992                          -- Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser
  accept 82
  turnin 1878                         -- Spigot Operator Luglunket
  turnin 1691                         -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The deep desert

step The Broken Pillar
  tip Ride south to the dig camp at the Broken Pillar. Marvon hands you a detector helm: wear it to see the Gahz'ridian mounds, which lie thick in the sand around the camp and south-west toward the ogres.
  accept 3161                         -- Marvon Rivetseeker
  collect 8443 quest 3161 @52.3,45.3 map 1446 -- Gahz'ridian Ornament
  turnin 3161

step Dunemaul Compound
  tip Ride south-west to the ogre compound. Brutes and Enforcers (46-48) fill it; Gor'marok the Ravager (49) stands in the middle with guards around him: clear them first.
  kill 5474 quest 5863                -- Dunemaul Brute
  kill 5472 quest 5863                -- Dunemaul Enforcer
  kill 12046 x1 quest 5863            -- Gor'marok the Ravager, below ground

step Thistleshrub Valley: kill these as you meet them
  zone Tanaris
  tip Ride south into Thistleshrub Valley. The Dew Collectors drop the glands; only some are full, so keep the Laden one. Gnarled Thistleshrubs and Rootshapers share the valley. The Thistleshrubs are 48-50, above you: pull one at a time.
  tip Careful: The other thistleshrub mobs in the area are level 49-50 and wander a lot, so you can easily pull extra mobs.
  collect 8428 x1 quest 2605          -- Laden Dew Gland
  kill 5485 quest 3362                -- Thistleshrub Rootshaper
  kill 5490 quest 3362                -- Gnarled Thistleshrub

step Tooga's escort
  tip The little turtle Tooga hides at the north end of the valley. Lead him home to his wife Torta, by the water just east of Steamwheedle Port: he walks slowly and the desert's beasts go for him, so keep him alive.
  accept 1560                         -- Tooga
  complete 1560

step The Noxious Lair
  tip Ride north-west to the Centipaar hive in the dunes. Any Centipaar can drop insect parts.
  tip Careful: Centipaar Swarmers cast Silithid Swarm both in and out of combat, which brings small adds that interrupt you.
  collect 8587 quest 82               -- Centipaar Insect Parts

step Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail
  collect 6257 quest 1452.1 @43.5,40.6 map 1446

step Steamwheedle Port
  turnin 8365                         -- Haughty Modiste
  note Stoley's next delivery goes back to Booty Bay: skip it.
  turnin 2875                         -- Security Chief Bilgewhizzle, inside
  turnin 8366
  turnin 2873                         -- Stoley, inside
  turnin 1560                         -- Torta

step Gadgetzan
  tip Ride back west to Gadgetzan.
  turnin 5863                         -- Andi Lynn, on the east side of town
  turnin 2605                         -- Marin Noggenfogger
  accept 2606
